<% if ds_present? -%>
<%= step("Turn DNSSEC off") %>

<%= outage_warning %>

1. Sign in at https://ap.www.namecheap.com/domains/list and choose **Manage** beside **<%= domain %>**.
2. Open **Advanced DNS**, find **DNSSEC**, and switch it off (delete any DS record listed). Change nothing else.
3. <%= confirm %>
4. <%= after_dnssec %>

<% end -%>
<%= step("Use Cloudflare's nameservers") %>

<%= ns_timing %>

1. Sign in at https://ap.www.namecheap.com/domains/list and choose **Manage** beside **<%= domain %>**.
2. On the **Domain** tab, under **Nameservers**, choose **Custom DNS**.
3. Enter exactly these two, replacing any others:
<%= ns_list %>
4. <%= confirm %> Save with the green check mark.
5. <%= done %>
